From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xun2202 <98207886+Xun2202@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 08:25:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): soften navigation hiding and use solid compact
 capsule labels

Shared with Mihon 0068. Raise the fast-throw threshold to 1400dp/s, require 18dp of normal upward travel, and accelerate only true fast hides. Keep slow reveal and one decision per pressed gesture. Replace difference/stroked canvas words with solid 14sp themed Text. Use handle-relative optical spacing with a 12dp floor; Android does not expose the visible handle rectangle, so real-device equality remains to be confirmed. Preserve glass shaders and interaction routing.
